  "question": {
    "text": "A monoatomic gas is compressed from a volume of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;</span>to a volume of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;at a constant pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. Then it is heated at constant volume by supplying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> of energy. As a result,&nbsp;the internal energy of the gas"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Decreases by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Increases by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Decreases by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Isobaric process with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">W</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mtext><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mtext><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mtext></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>J</mtext></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mtext>&#160;J</mtext></math><br /><br />Constant volume with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>J</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>5</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>J</mo> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Hence, internal energy increases by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>"
  }
